  "descriptionEn": "First archived Berlin source snapshot for upper-secondary mathematics. The snapshot activates the phase anchors of the introductory and qualification phases together with the four course semesters and the first reviewed Q1 differentiation corridor as well as the first reviewed Q2 integral-calculus corridor, the first reviewed Q2 stochastics corridor, the first reviewed Q2 data-and-survey corridor, and the first reviewed Q4 distribution-and-binomial corridor.",
